# QA M3, Stage 4: time-up during the Durchkriechstein crawl (D-060: dying
# mid-crawl keeps the crawl state until the respawn, then a normal
# standing player). The falkenstein_crawl_normal route to the boulder's
# face at the mouth, then Resi waits there until the timer shows 1 and
# holds DOWN: the crawl starts at 15262, the timer runs out at 15300 with
# her half-way through the tunnel (no +1 life). She respawns at the
# checkpoint (15360, col 116) as Normal, standing (hitbox top 394 = 22 px
# on row 26), timer 255, and walks normally.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = event=CrawlStarted dies_at frames=15300..15300 deaths=1 lives=2 no_event=ExtraLife event=Respawned
expect = state=playing power=normal player_y>=394 player_y<=394 player_x>=1858
